    "title": "Leeks and mushrooms",
    "text": "Sweat the leeks and mushrooms in the same pan over medium heat until the leeks go soft, 3–4 minutes, adding oil if it looks dry. Stir in the garlic and tomato paste and cook 2 minutes."
