    "text": "Melt 1 Tbsp butter in a saucepan over medium until it foams, cook the rosemary in it for a minute, then take the rosemary out. Whisk in the broth mixture and the reserved pot-roast sauce and simmer 5–7 minutes until it thickens. Stir in the vinegar and the reserved pot roast, heat it through, season, and keep it warm."
